OL,3,ATrump rejects Iran deal to reopen
OL,4,AStrait of Hormuz in seven days
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, Araghchi had told reporters
OL,7,Fat the UN in New York that an agreement
OL,8,Fcould be reached "if the necessary
OL,9,Fconditions are met" and that these were
OL,10,Fcontained in a memorandum of
OL,11,Funderstanding (MOU) signed by the two
OL,12,Fcountries in June.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
